{"id":"506d4c1ef995492c","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-base.md","title":"ZFC Ultrafilter Base","display":"df-zfc-ultrafilter-base — ZFC Ultrafilter Base","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-base","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-base"],"display":"df-zfc-ultrafilter-base — ZFC Ultrafilter Base","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-filter-base]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-base"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ultrafilter-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ultrafilter-base — ZFC Ultrafilter Base"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e13f8d7f11bb676\" href=\"?note=8e13f8d7f11bb676\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter-base\">58-df-zfc-filter-base</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B,X,A,B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal B,X,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (filter-base predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrafilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrafilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq A\\lor B\\subseteq X\\setminus A\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq A\\lor B\\subseteq X\\setminus A\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The decision clause is equivalent to maximality of the filter generated upward from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter-base","status":"resolved","id":"8e13f8d7f11bb676","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter-base]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B,X,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrafilterBase}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}base} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FilterBase}_S(\\mathcal B,X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\bigl(B\\subseteq A\\lor B\\subseteq X\\setminus A\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":880,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3849","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerp